Hi Chiara,

You could use a genomic relationship matrix using a relatedness_factor = 0.5 as shown below.

> library(dartR)
> res <- gl.grm(platypus.gl <http://platypus.gl>)
> res2 <- gl.grm.network(res,x=platypus.gl <http://platypus.gl>,relatedness_factor = 0.5)

Cheers,
Luis

